<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version 3</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mik</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Mika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mika</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Zina dya Mika didumulwa kulawa mwe zina dya Mikaya, kwa longa dya Chiebulaniya ni kugamba, ni yuhi akwinga Zumbe?. Muwoni Mika atambalisaga chipindi ichiya cha muwoni Isaya mihilimo ya 750 kubula 700 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Utambalisi wakwe wendaga kwa wekazi wo ulongozi wa kwamwenyemzi ukwitangwa Yuda, kaula Isaya 1:1. Kwaviya ulosi wa Mika hantu hakulu waligana na ulosi wa Isaya, wamanyi wa mbuli za Bibiliya wafanyanya vyadahika Mika endaga yumwenga mwa wanampina wa Isaya, Isaya 8:16. Mwe kaline ya mnane Kulisito henati, ulimi na mayombe ni ndima zadindimale mwe isi ya Izulaeli na Yuda. Hata ivyo mbuli za wavu nazo iviya nazijenyela, ukakaula ulongozi wa Isaya na Hosea na Amosi. Vilongozi wa mbuli za kumvikila Chohile watambalisa mbuli zikwegemela kubunyanya na kumolanya chani wapate vintu, vyaleka wamfuzumila muwoni Mika kwa ulosi alavize, 2:6, 11 na 3:5. Saviya wawoni watuhu wa Zumbe, Mika kakwahihila vidala imbuli iyo. Ulosi ulavigwe ni Mika uhanganya wa uwoni wose wa wawoni mwe ichipindi icho. Chohile aunga wantu wakwe wahitwile ntendwa zawo na mijendele yawo, wadamanye vikuwagila, watende na mbazi na kwikalwa wikazi wa kunyanyaha kwa Chohile ywawo, 6:8. Mika awafunda wantu kugamba haneile amasa yawo mizi yawo mikulu naibogozolwe ne seuta zawo nazibalagwe. Mika kalotela hali pya ya wambulwa. Wantu nawasigale nawambulwe na seuta ywa utondowazi nelekwe komzi wa Betelehemu Efulata, uyo natunduliye bunga kutimila viya akunga Zumbe, 212-13, na 4:1-4, 5:2, 4 na soni zawo nahitulwe kutenda chinyemi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Nkanto ya Chohile mwa Hukumu ya Mungu Izulaeli na Yuda, Sula 1-3</para>
  <para style="io">2 Ndagano ya Chohile ikumlanga ulongozi wa Mwambula, Sula 4-5</para>
  <para style="io">3. Laho hya dya Izulaeli, Sula 6:1-7:7</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kwekiya na msuhi, Sula 7:8-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile umwizile Mika mntu kulawa komzi wa Molesheti, chipindi icho Yotamu na Ahaziya na Hezekia nawo wendaga maseuta wa Yuda. Mika awonaga mbuli zose izo zikuilanga imizi ya Samaliya na Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile naikantile Samaliya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Tegelezani nyuwe wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">nyuwe nyose mkwikala muno mweisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Zumbe Chohile eza kuwalahani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Zumbe alonga kulawa mwe Inyumba yakwe ikukile.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Kaulani Zumbe Chohile eza kulawa ko wikazi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:3">nasele na kujenda mlanga mwe ivinenengwe vye isi. <verse eid="MIC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Magulu nayalolomoke hasi he iviga vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">saviya nta ihajihi na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">mabwandasi nayatulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">saviya mazi yakuguluka mwe seleza. <verse eid="MIC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Yose ayo nayalaile kwachausa cho ubanasi wa welekwa wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">kwachausa cha masa ya welekwa wa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Togola ubanasi wa Yakobo wawoneka kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Ko umzi wakwe mkulu wa Samaliya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Ubanasi wa Yuda wawoneka komzi wa Yelusalemu wenye! <verse eid="MIC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">“Umzi wa Samaliya naniutende mahame kwenyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">nkonde wantu nawahande mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">Mayuwe yazengele ichegamo chakwe naniyadule hasi kwedikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">ivyegamo vyakwe nanivisimbule.<verse eid="MIC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />Matukulu yakwe yose nayatulwe tulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">chila chintu chatahigwe nachitikimye moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">vinyago vyakwe vyose navibalangwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">Navichisanywa kulawana na maliho yo uchilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">navijesezwe vituhu kulihila uchilanga kwesi ntuhu.”<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />Mika niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">“Mwe imbuli ino, miye nanile na kulomboleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">nanijende sivaile makwapa naho mwazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">Nanile na kulomboleza saviya chigwema, nanisulumile na kwila enga mbuni.<verse eid="MIC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Makwenje ya Samaliya hayakuhonyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">nayo yagwa mwe isi ya Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">yabula mwe inchili ya Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">hantu wakwikala wantu wangu.”<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizungu ya wankondo mwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Imbuli ino msekwilonga uko komzi wa Gati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">msekwila mkalawa mesozi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">Uko Beti leafula mgalegale mwa malumbi kwa chinyulu. <verse eid="MIC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Nyuwe wantu wa Shafili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">hitani kosamizo, mkatenda mwi mwazi na kuhuza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Wekazi wa Zaanani msekufosa mo umzi wenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Awantu wa Beti hezeli walomboleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">wambizi wenyu mwawo uswa. <verse eid="MIC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />Wantu wakwikala komzi wa Molati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">wagoja wambizi kwa nkwina ikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">mna file yeza kulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">haguhi ne inchili ya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MIC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Nyuwe wantu mkwikala Lakishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">malanyani malingisha ya nkondo yakukweswa ni falasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">Nyuwe nendile mtimiliza masa ya wantu we isi ya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">ubanasi wadamanye wantu wa Izulaeli nanywi muudamanya. <verse eid="MIC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Haluse, mwaungwa mlagane na kuwasa awekazi wa Molasheti gati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:14">Na umzi wa Akizibu hauwambize maseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="MIC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Nyuwe wantu wa Malesha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">Zumbe Chohile nawaleteleni mnkondo nawa taheni vituhu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 1:15">Vilongozi wakutunyiswa wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">nawasumkile kwe mpanga uko Adulamu. <verse eid="MIC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Nyuwe wantu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">wegulani luhala kulagisa mwalombolezeza wana wenyu mkungisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">kwaviya wana wenyu nawawaseni na kwigalwa ko usamizo.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s">Wakubunyanya wachiwa nawaluwone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Nawaluwone wadya wakwika mizungu ya kudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">wakugona nechilo kuno walafya wihi! Iviya kukakucha waujesa kwaviya wana udahi. <verse eid="MIC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />Wameila mate nkonde na kuziguha, wakaunga nyumba waguha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">Wawabunyanya wata nyumba na wantu we izikaya zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">wahoka wantu ugoli wawo. <verse eid="MIC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile agamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">“Nemalanya niwegaile file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">iyo hamdahe hata kuyenega.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">Nachitende chipindi chihiye kwenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">naho hamdahe kujenda kuno mwefenya. <verse eid="MIC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />Ichipindi icho chikabula wantu nawawasezengeni na kulomboleza kwa usungu wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Chisila pele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Zumbe Chohile kaguha isi yetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">kayusa mwe imkono yetu. Izinkonde zetu kawenka wadya wachitahile.” <verse eid="MIC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Elo, hampangile chihendo chochose mgati mwe isanga ya awantu wa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />Wantu wanigamba, “Usekuchitambalisiza suwe, mbuli seizo sizo za kutambalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">suwe hachigwelwe ni file. <verse eid="MIC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Togola, nyuwe welekwa wa Yakobo mwaungwa mlonge seivyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Togola Zumbe Chohile kaleka ujijijmizi wakwe? Togola, uyo adamanya mbuli seizo?” <verse eid="MIC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />Mna Zumbe Chohile awagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">“Nyuwe mwawebunga awantu wangu enga wankondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">Mwawahoka izisuche zawo wantu wahoile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">wantu wakujinka waita zawo hewene nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">na hewene fanyanyi zozose za nkondo. <verse eid="MIC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Wavyele wa wantu wangu mwawabalaza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">kulawa mwe izinyumba zawo ntana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">awana wawo muwausiza ugoli wawo kale na kale. <verse eid="MIC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Inukani mwite zenyu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">Hano hahana vituhu hantu hakwika ntulwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">Kwa kuswesa ukanuni kwenyu, mwagojwa ni file!” <verse eid="MIC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />“Uneva alaile mtu na kulonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">milosi ya buli dyo udanti kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">‘Nawaletelani divai na mpombe zilozize’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">mtambalisi sauyo nakaungiswa ni wano awantu.” <verse eid="MIC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />“Mna, chindedi naniwachisanyeni nyuwe awantu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">heye naniwachisanye nyuwe Waizulaeli msigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">niwaleteni hamwenga saviya ngoto mwe dewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">saviya fyo dya ngoto koludimo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">nanywi namtende bunga dya wantu walozize.”<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />Yudya natule isila nawalongweleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">wowo nawavune inchili yo mzi na kufosa kuse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Seuta ywawo nawalongwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Zumbe Chohile mwenye nawalongwele.<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s">Mika awakwahila vilongozi wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />Tegelezani, nyuwe masekulu wa welekwa wa Yakobo tegelezani nyuwe vilongozi welekwa wa Izulaeli, nyuwe mwaungwa mmanye mbuli zo uwagila, <verse eid="MIC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />mna nyuwe mwehiwa ayedi na kunga yehiye. Nyuwe mwawazuna izinkanda awantu wangu, na kuhata izinyama mwa mavuha yawo. <verse eid="MIC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />Nyuwe mwikala saviya wantu wakudya nyama za wantu wangu na kuwazuna izinkankanda zawo, mwatula amavuha yawo. Mwawajeseza unyakwili walukolo wenyu saviya nyama ikwambikwa mwe nyungu. <verse eid="MIC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Chipindi cheza aho namumwilile Zumbe Chohile, mna uyo hawahituleni. Hayahitule amalombezo yenyu kwaviya mdamanya mbuli za wavu. <verse eid="MIC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino mwa wawoni wakwaza wantu wakwe, wawoni wakulotela utondowazi wanenkigwa chintu, mna hawanenkigwe chintu wawatisa wantu kwa nkondo. <verse eid="MIC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />“Elo, chilo nachiwezileni msekudaha kuwona uwoni, naho mwenyu namtende chiza msekudaha kulotela. Waoni awo nawaswelwe ni zuwa na msi kwawo nautende chiza.” <verse eid="MIC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Walotezi nawengile soni na walaguzi nawahayuswe. Wose nawahuze kwaviya Chohile hawahitule. <verse eid="MIC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Mna miye simemezwa nguvu na loho ni Zumbe Chohile na uwagila na udahi, vileke nimtambalisize Yakobo uwavu wakwe na kuwagambila wantu wa Izulaeli masa yawo. <verse eid="MIC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Tegelezani, nyuwe vilongozi wa welekwa wa Yakobo, tegelezani nyuwe mkwihiwa mbuli zo uwagila na kuhitulizanya mbuli zichumile zitende ziha. <verse eid="MIC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />Nyuwe mwazenga umzi wa Sayuni kwa kukoma wantu hewene lema na kuzenga umzi wa Yelusalemu kwa kubunyanya. <verse eid="MIC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />Walamuzi wadamanya ndima yawo kwa kufumbaswa, walavyantambiko wakwe wahinya kwa maliho, wawoni walotela kwa matundu. Mna weduvya kugamba wamwegamila Zumbe Chohile, wakagamba, “Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na suwe, hachipatwe ni file yoyose.” <verse eid="MIC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />Elo, kwachausa chenyu, umzi wa Sayuni naulimwe saviya nkonde na Yelusalemu nautende mahame na hantu henukile he Inyumba ya Chohile nautende mbago.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile alonngoza wantu wose kwa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 2:1-4">Isaya 2:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Mwa amazuwa yo udumo, lugulu luzengigwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile nalutogezwe na kutenda lukulu kujinka amagulu yose, nalwinulwe kujinka awagulu wose na awantu mwe izisi zose nawahinge uko,<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />si zilozize nazilubase na kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">“Chiteni kulanga kolugulu lwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">chiteni kwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">vileke achihinye izisila zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">naswi chitongele viya akudamanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Kwaviya sigilizi yalawa Sayuni.”<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />Chohile nalamwile nkumbizi mgati mwe si zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">iviya nakante mgati mwe izisi zina nguvu zihale na zihajihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Mabamba yawo nawayasane yatende majembe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">maguha yawo yatende nyengo za kuhogoila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Si haigombe nkondo na si ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">hawahine vituhu mbuli za kugomba nkondo.<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />Chila mntu nekale kwa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">mwe inkonde yakwe ye imizabibu ne imiti ikwitangwa mtini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">hehena kutiswa ni mntu yoyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">Nivyo alongile Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Kwaviya wantu mwe izisi ntuhu watimila sila zawo, kwa kwikiya msuhi milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:5">mna suwe chatimila sila zetu kwa kumsankanila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu kale na kale.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli nawauye kulawa ko usamizo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />Zumbe Choile agamba, “Mwe idizuwa idyo, naniwachisanye wantu nakantilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">wadya wasulumizagwa ko usamizo.<verse eid="MIC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />Wadya waholomale nawodu nasigale no ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">awo waguhigwe kwita ko usamizo nawatende is ina nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">Miye Zumbe Chohile nanilongoze ko ulugulu lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">kukongela chipindi icho kubula kale na kale.”<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />Weye Yelusalemu weye nchinga ya Sayuni, hantu Chohile akuwadima awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">enga mdimi mwe izingoto zakwe, weye notende vituhu mzi umanyikise saviya aho nkongo, Yelusalemu nautende vituhu mzi mkulu wa seuta.<verse eid="MIC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Haluse kwambwani mwaila kwa izwi kulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Kwaviya hamna seuta vituhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Mlangilizi ywako kaga? Mwaguta enga mntu mta usungu wa kwefungula!<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Nyuwe wantu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">ilani na kugalagala saviya mvyele akwefungula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Kwaviya haluse namlawe mo umzi uno mwite mkekale kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">namwite kubula komzi wa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Mna uko namwambulwe ni Zumbe Chohile mwe mikono ya wankondo wenyu.<verse eid="MIC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Wantu mwe si zilozize wechisanya wawebungeni. Wagamba, “Lekani umzi wa Yelusalemu ubalangwe chiuwone ukatenda mahame!”<verse eid="MIC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Mna wowo hawamanyize izifanyani za Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">naho hawakukombaganya umwalo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">Kugamba kawachisanya hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">saviya machisa ya mhunga hantu hakuhutila.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Nyuwe wantu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">inukani mkawebunge awankondo wenyu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Naniwenkeni nguvu saviya njeku ina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">mahembe ya chuma na ngaga za shaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Namhude wantu mwe si zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">upati wawo namuusente kwa chausa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">ugoli wawo namnilavize miye Zumbe we isi yose.”<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="s">Chilongozi mhya kulawa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Nyuwe wantu wa Yelusalemu, kwechisanyeni mwe mabunga ya wagomba nkondo! Kwaviya chifinkanywa ni chilongozi ywa Izulaeli atoigwa nkome mwe funda! <verse eid="MIC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Betelehemu wi Efulata, weye wi mdodo du mwa awakaya wa Yuda, mna mwako namlawe chilongozi nalongoze mwa Izulaeli kwachausa changu. Kolwa dyakwe ni dya chikale na chikale.” <verse eid="MIC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile nawase wantu wakwe mwe wankondo, kubula aho mvyele yudya msoka nasuzamile. Vikaheza walukolo wakwe wasigale nawauye na kulungana na Waizulaeli weyawe. <verse eid="MIC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />Chilongozi uyo nawadime awantu wakwe kwa udahi ukulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile na kwa ukulu wa Chohile mwenye. Wantu wakwe nawekale mpeho kwaviya natende sekulu kubula uhelo we isi, <verse eid="MIC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />uyo nuyo nawadime wantu wakwe kwa utondowazi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MIC 5:5">Ukombolwa na nkanto</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 5:5">Umo antu wa Ashulu wanayebunge isi yetu niyo wavuna ingome yetu, nachigale wamizi mfungate na masekulu mnane wakatowane nawo. <verse eid="MIC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />Nawaibalange isi ya Ashulu kwa viziha vyawo na kuitaha isi ya Nimlodi. Nachikombole kulawa mwe imikono ya Waashulu umo wanabula mwe imihaka ye isi yetu. <verse eid="MIC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Wantu wa Izulaeli nawasigale no ujima nawazagale mwe si zilozize nawatende saviya mnyuzu ukulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile, uge mavunde yakulagala mwe mani heyetumigwe ni mntu hegu kuhoswa ni mntu. <verse eid="MIC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />Welekwa wa Yakobo nawasigale no ujima mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu zilozize nawatende na nguvu nkulu saviya simba mgati mwa wanyama wa kumbago, awo nawatende saviya wana simba moluwala, wengile mgati mwe mabunga ya ngoto na kuzebunga na kuzisapula vihande hande chila hantu zikujinka hahana mntu yoyose akaudaha kwambula. <verse eid="MIC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Waizulaeli nawawahude na kuwakoma awankondo wawo wose. <verse eid="MIC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Chipindi icho falasi zenyu nanizuse, na kuyabalanga amalingisha yenyu. <verse eid="MIC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />Mizi ye isi yenyu naniibalange, na kubogozola izingome zenyu. <verse eid="MIC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />Mbuli zenyu zo usai nanizuse, nanywi hamtende na wasinya milamulo vituhu. <verse eid="MIC 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />Matukulu yenyu naniyabalange, ne nguzo zenyu zo kuvikila, nanywi namhele kuvikila vintu mdamanye wenye. <verse eid="MIC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />Matukulu ya Ashela naniyang'ole kulawa kwenyu, na kuibalanga imizi yenyu. <verse eid="MIC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />Nanilihize chikoda kwa maya yangu yatendese mwe izisi zose hezikuniva miye.”<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile awalaha Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli tegelezani icho akulonga Zumbe Chohile. Chimala wegombele mwa amagulu na wagulu nawo weve ikulonga. <verse eid="MIC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />Tegelezani laho dya Zumbe Chohile nyuwe magulu, tegelezani nyuwe vyegamo vitogese vye isi!, Zumbe Chohile ana laho na wantu wakwe. Uyo nalavye malaho mwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="MIC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Nyuwe wantu wangu siwatendani mbwani? Siwasokezani kwa chintu chani? Nihitulani. <verse eid="MIC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />Miye siwalavyani kulawa kwe isi ya Misili, siwakombolani kulawa ko utumwa, nasiwenkani Musa na Haluni na maliamu chani wawalongozeni. <verse eid="MIC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />Nyuwe wantu wangu kumbukani mwalo wa Balaki seuta ywa Moabu na viya Balamu mwana ywa Beoli amhitule. Kumbukani ayo yalaile mwe ntambo yenyu kulawa Shitimu kubula Giligali. Kumbukani vileke mbunkule izintendwa zangu zo kuwakombolani.” <verse eid="MIC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />Nimbase Zumbe Chohile na chintu chani, vileke nimvikile Chohile ekulanga? Togola nimbase na malavyo ya kutikimya, hegu nimlavize ndama ya mhilimo umwenga? <verse eid="MIC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Togola, Zumbe Chohile nelelwe ninamlaviza maelufu ya ndolome, mito maelufu ya mavuta? Hegu nimlavize mwelekwa ywangu ywa nkongo nilihe ubanasi wangu, mwana neleke mwenye kwachausa cha masa yangu? <verse eid="MIC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Bule, Zumbe Chohile kachigambila yadya ayedi, icho akunga mwetu ni kudamanya mbuli zo uwagila na kulagisa mbazi na wikazi wa kunyanyahala kwa Chohile ywako. <verse eid="MIC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Zumbe Chohile awetanga awekazi wo umzi, ni mbuli ikuwagila kumvikila uyo, tegelezani nyuwe wantu wa Yuda, “Tegelezani nyuwe mchisanyike mo umzi! <verse eid="MIC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Togola, nanijijimize wavu uumbikwe mnyumba mwawo, ugoli upatikane kwa udanti, mbuli iyo ni ihizo? <verse eid="MIC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />Togola, nadaha nigambe hawana mlema wakujeseza vihimo vyo udanti na mayuwe heyekuwagila? <verse eid="MIC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Wagoli mwe imizi wamema ubunyanyi, awekazi wakwe walonga udanti, icho wakulonga nu udanti. <verse eid="MIC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Elo, miye sikonga kuwagwisani hasi na kuwakomani kwachausa cha masa yenyu. <verse eid="MIC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Namdye mna hamwigute, mndani mwenyu namjendeleze kulumwa ni sala. Mkaika mpamba haikale, mnaika chintu nachidigwe ni nkanga. <verse eid="MIC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Namhande mbeyu, mna hamvune. Namfumbule zaituni, mna mavuta yakwe hamyadye. Namfumbule zabubi, mna hamnywe idivai iyo. <verse eid="MIC 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />Nyuwe mwatimila mligano wihiye wa seuta Omali na mligano wa awantu we ikaya ya seuta Ahabu na mligano wihiye wa awantu we ikaya ya mwana ywa Ahabu naho mtimila izimbuli zawo. Elo, naniwegaile ubanasi, nambelwe ni chila mntu. Namtilwe ni wantu chila hantu.”<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s">Fuzumo dya muwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />Miye nanluwone! Kwaviya siligana na hantu havunigwe kale, hahana tini za nkongo za kwikiya msuhi. Ni saviya chipindi cho uvuni wa zabibu, hahana hata kikocha chimwenga cha zabibu cha kudya. <verse eid="MIC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Mwe isi hamna asigale akumsankanila Chohile, hamna mchimi ywa moyo mgati mwa awantu. Chila yumwenga anyatila vileke akome, chila yumwenga ahiza amgwize mlukolo ywakwe. <verse eid="MIC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />Wose wadahisa kudamanya yehiye. Vilongozi na wakanti waungisa kufumbaswa. Wakulu walagisa pwilili imyalo yawo ihiye na kuijesa. <verse eid="MIC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Mntu ywedi kujinka wose mgati mwao nisaviya mishongoma, mntu akuwonekana kachuma mgati mwa wose nuyo ehiye kujinka miwa ya mishongoma. Idizuwa nadikagojwa dye inkanto yako dibula. Haluse chila yumwenga kagilwa. <verse eid="MIC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />Usekwika ukanuni mwa mnyawo, hegu kwika msuhi kwa mbuyayo. Dima chiya ukulonga kwa mlomo wako, hata na mkaziwo mwenye. <verse eid="MIC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />Kwaviya mwana chilume ambela ise, mwana chiche ahigana na nine, mkamwana ahigana na nine vyala, wankondo wa mntu ni wantu wa mwe ikaya yakwe. <verse eid="MIC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Mna miye naika msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Namgoja Chohile mta kunikombola, Chohile ywangu nanitegeleze.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile aleta ukombolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />Weye mnkondo ywangu, usekwelelwa mwe file yangu. Hagwa naninuke vituhu. Hatenda mwe chiza, Zumbe Chohile nanilangazize. <verse eid="MIC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />Kwaviya simkola masa Zumbe Chohile, vyaungwa nijijimize amaya yakwe, kubula hadya nanigombele ulahi wangu na kuninka uwagila wangu. Nanigale kuse ko ulangazi, naniwone akadamanya uwagila. <verse eid="MIC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />Elo, awankondo wetu nawawone soni na kuhuza, kwaviya wachuzaga, “Ekuhi Zumbe Chohile ywenyu?” Miye mwenye nanimwone mnkondo ywangu akagwa na kujatwajatwa hasi enga ntagata mwesila. <verse eid="MIC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />Mazuwa yeza, iviwambaza vyo umzi wenyu navizengwe uhya. Mwa amazuwa ayo mihaka ye isi yenyu nayangamulwe. <verse eid="MIC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />Mwa amazuwa ayo walukolo wenyu nawauye mwenyu kulawa Ashulu ulailo wa zuwa ne imizi ya Misili ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, kulawa kwe izikaya zo umto wa Efulate na kulawa kwe Bahali ya hale na magulu ya hale. <verse eid="MIC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Isi naitende ibule kwachausa cha wavu wa awekazi wakwe.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Zumbe Chohile, wadime wantu wako kwa udahi wako, wantu usagule mwenye, awo wakwikala ichedu kwenyika, wazungulukwa ni sanga ihoile. Uwadime saviya utendile hadya nkongo mwa amadimilo ya Bashani na Giliyadi. <verse eid="MIC 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />Naniwalagiseni mpituko saziya nadamanyaga mwa amazuwa yadya niwalavizeni kwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="MIC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Wantu we izisi ntuhu nawawone na kuhuza hata hegu wana udahi. Nawakangawale na kuswesa cha kulonga na kutenda enga hawakwiva. <verse eid="MIC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />Nawatambale mwa malumbi saviya nyoka, enga vyumbe vikutambala mwe sanga. Nawafose mwe izingome zawo wakazingiza kuno wamema nkama. Nawakuhitukile weye Chohile ywetu kwa nkama, nawogohe kwachausa chako. <verse eid="MIC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />Hahana Chohile mtuhu akwinga weye, weye walekeila masa ya wantu wako wasigale, hukukaula ubanasi wawo. Maya yako hayakwikalisa, mna waungisa kuchilagisa mbazi zako. <verse eid="MIC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nochifile mbazi vituhu, nochusize amasa yetu yose, noyadule kwe mizimilizo ye ibahali! <verse eid="MIC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />Wantu wako nowalagise ukanuni wako na mbazi zako, kwa welekwa wa Ibulahimu na Yakobo, saviya wawagambilaga wakale wetu mwe chikale.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>